<!--Post: 4126--><!--Time: 1105712333-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4126"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Eyes Wide Open<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 14, 2005 - 6:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK,you don&#39;t play by rules, are you sure everybody else does? <BR> <BR>Who&#39;s watching you? <BR> <BR>You&#39;ve started a nice little game here..  But one thing you have to ask yourself when you start any game: Who else wants to play? What else wants to play?  Whose rules are they gonna play by? <BR> <BR>Who&#39;s watching you? <BR> <BR>What happened to that tissue you blew your nose on?  Are you sure you really want to drink from that straw, from that cup, from that can?  What happened to the hair that popped out of your aging scalp today, what happened to the dandruff?  What slip up have you made today?  What one little thing that you&#39;ve thought nothing of that someone, somewhere has just been quietly, patiently waiting on?  Who&#39;s in on it?  Is it that waitress in the restaurant, what about the busboy?  Can you trust your doctor?  What about the nurse?  Who is the lab technician?  Do you really want to send that coat to the cleaners? Who is that guy who collects your garbage?  Who&#39;s sitting next to you?  Who can you trust? <BR> <BR>What kind of Pandora&#39;s Box have you opened? You&#39;ve drawn a big target on your back. You&#39;ve made yourself the hottest game in town.  Who else wants to play? What else wants to play?  You&#39;re a fish in a fishbowl, BTK.  Who&#39;s watching you?  The young lions are snapping at your heels, the sheep are growing fangs, and the monsters are slouching toward Wichita, lurking in the shadows.  Thirty years is a long time ago, you sure you&#39;re still the only monster in town?  What else is slithering out of the woodwork, drawn by the promise of fame?  Are you sure you&#39;re the only one in Wichita who wants it?  Who wants it more badly than you? Who wants you so much they can smell your flesh even in their sleep?  Who wants to eat you with their eyes? What was that noise you heard last night, BTK, sure it was just the house settling?  That movement you thought you caught out of the corner of your eye, are you really sure it was just your imagination?  Who is that person you thought was looking at you just a bit too long for comfort?  <BR> <BR>Who now has the passion that time and age have choked, strangled, suffocated out of you?   <BR> <BR>Who&#39;s waiting, BTK?  Who&#39;s lurking? Who&#39;s planning?  Who&#39;s plotting?  <BR>  <BR>Who&#39;s watching you?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4126-->
