<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4218"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ahungered<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 16, 2005 - 9:53 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dearest BTK, <BR> <BR>I am closer now, so very close, close enough to touch you.  Do you know what it is like to want something so much, to desire someone so much that your desire for them makes your very bones ache, makes your blood stand still in your veins?  My every thought is of you.  You have turned me into a animal, the whole world stops for you.  When I sleep, when I can sleep, it is your face I see.  Your voice has become the melody of my soul.  I have been watching and waiting and I have been so patient.  My hand was stayed before, because I did not obey, but now I have been rewarded and you have been given over into my hands. I have been promised that you will be mine.  So shall you be.   <BR> <BR>It has been hard, never have I hunted such prey before. It is harder because I am not the only one watching.  They are watching too.  But they shall not have you, you have been promised to me!  They want to lock you away where I cannot get to you, they want to keep me from what has been promised to me.  I am much smarter than them.  They see you, but they do not see me.  You have seen me because I wanted you to see me, but you do not know me yet.  But you will know me and I will know you. I will leave them enough to identify you by, this is my promise to you.  I will capture your soul in my mouth as it departs from your lips.  They will still fear you because you will live forever through me.  You will be a part of me. This is a great honor I give to you. <BR> <BR>I am so thankful for the food I am about to receive.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
