<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4405"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lynette795<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lynette795<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 21, 2005 - 9:01 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Attention BTK: <BR>	I am tired of running, hiding and living my life to be “safe” from you!  You make me sick!  Your mother was right you are a disgusting  little worm.  Why did you want to have sex with your sister anyway?  Couldn’t you find a date outside of your own family?  Be a man!  Face me head on, don’t sneak in my back door.  I want to meet with you, as we have unfinished business, you and I.  You will take no more from me.  You are a coward.    Send me a note!  You know how and where to send it, don’t you?  I have a special surprise for you!  I live very near the trains.  I’ll be waiting for your reply! <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
