<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4498"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Love of God<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 22, 2005 - 3:07 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK:asi have said before Jesus died on the crossfor all of mankind including you.Confess your sins to God and belive on the Son and the  truth will set you free.Greater is he that is inyou &#40;Christ&#41; than he that is in the world&#40;meaning the monster&#40;Devil&#41;,orSatin or what everyou want to call him. All have sinned and came short the glory of God &#40;Romans&#41; I don&#39;t knowyour age but I know that  one can die at any time.You still have a choice Heaven or Hell.Jesus died on the Cross to save allsinners nomatter how great the sin with the exception of one.&#40;Holy Ghost&#41; I am not a preacher,but Iam a beleiver,thatwhosoever beleves on him &#40;Jesus&#41; shall not perish but have everlasting life.                   I will pray for you<!--/Text--></td></tr>
