<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4554"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:BALDGUY0123@AOL.COM" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->BRUCE PEDERSEN<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 23, 2005 - 2:17 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK: have spent the whole week-end reading these postings, have you? human beings are telling you we want to find you!we will . hopefully soon. on a personal note,I dont think you are even in your 50&#39;s. I think your father was the original btk,he commited suicide, and when he died,you followed in his place. they are all looking for someone old and you are fooling them so far. you have had 30 years to study your old man&#39;s routine and if  the law doesn&#39;t catch you soon,you are gonna &#34;get off&#34; and kill someone. you are NOT sick, insane or crazy. you are a serial killer. science has proven this with other killers. the most important thing you need to know is you will NEVER escape the wrath of GOD..... <BR>&#39; <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
