<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4599"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Mother Goddess<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 24, 2005 - 5:53 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->My dearest BTK, <BR>Tell me, has anyone deciphered your cryptic message of 15 January, 2005? Is it really from you or is it just a hoax? I know that the cryptoquote posted in December is from you. Alas, I have only been able to decipher it in part. Let&#39;s see if you agree: I will begin with the fourteenth letter L and stop at the second number 24.  <BR>LASDDICIKILLIDs24COP9AT24 <BR>translation: Los Angeles Sheriff&#39;s Department Detective Kill &#40;not sure of next 3 letters please help&#41;24 &#40;the number of years the detective worked at LAPD/LASD COP 9 &#40;number of kills for BTK&#41; <BR>I know who you are and you know who I am &#40;and where I am so stop the cat and mouse the gig is up&#41;. I got your emails. Haven&#39;t had time to decipher the ones from yesterday. We know that you are ill and we CAN help you. You&#39;re ill, so no prison, OK? Just medical care in a humane facility. What about it KENT T. BILLINGHAM? It&#39;s ok son we know. Please come home to us.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4599-->
<!--Post: 4604--><!--Time: 1106582324-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4604"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Love of God<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 24, 2005 - 7:58 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK: Ihope  and pray that you have confessedyour sins,and gave your heart to God. Has jesus died in vain because of the heardness of our hearts?Idon&#39;t think so.Iknow you are scared and feel that no one cares for you. Jesus cares&#39;and so doIalthough I do&#39;nt approve of beating, torture,or killing. It is however not for me to judge. Look how many people Paul killed or had killed&#39;yet Paul turned out to be a great wittness for Christ. Yes he was beat,&amp; killed, but now I am sure he holds a crown. Write me back if you can somehow,and let me know if you accept Christ &amp; confess your sins.  Yours in Christ<!--/Text--></td></tr>
