<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4664"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elaine Dddvsai<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 24, 2005 - 9:48 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTW, did you know that there is an ARROWHEAD street here where I live that turns to an Iriquois street?  Amazing...and I don&#39;t even live in Kansas.   <BR> <BR>I find it a strange coincidence that you mentioned two streets that exist in another place I have never been and those exist right near where I live.  Amazing.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
