<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4726"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tornado<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tornado<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 3:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Well, guess you are up to your package dropping again....2 in fact.  Guess you are also watching the news to see your NAME getting local and probably national attention once again.  I am now convinced that you would not be giving up your prizes unless you were dying and not wanting your relatives to find any evidence connecting you to your other life as BTK.  Guess you plan on taking it with you to your grave...which leaves it between you and GOD.      <!--/Text--></td></tr>
