<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4728"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->waiting<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 3:21 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK they can&#39;t find the 7th communication I know how important your communications are to you you want things to be known the right way. You have to leave us know what the 7th communication was somehow you have to get that one out there again. I knew you were not gone you want us to know your true story and BTK we want to hear it from you. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
