<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4735"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Love of  God<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 5:23 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK: Yes it is good that you are getting rid of the packages you held onto so long. I think you are scared of getting caught,or you want to get caught and get it over with. Whatever the case please don&#39;t commit suicide. Go to a Church &amp; get down on your knees and confess your sins to God,  <BR>and ask God what he wants you to do. God will give you an answer. If you are bad sick &amp; feel that you are dying I need to know as  I will pray for you. Your soul is of my concern,and if you are saved may the glory be to God. A note to the paper or the police would be nice also. It would help a lot of people feel safer.  Your Friend in Christ.     <!--/Text--></td></tr>
