<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4745"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Temperance<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 6:34 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Give yourself up and make amends. Hell is not pretty and you have time to give the WPD details and come clean. Make up your mind to turn yourself in. <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
