<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4747"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Featherw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Featherw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 6:37 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Turn yourself in or go unnoticed when it comes your turn to depart this Earth. What was the purpose of being clever all this time and wanting your claim to fame for brilliance if you die and noone knows you were the BTK?   <BR> <BR>It is your choice.  We all want to know who you are. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
