<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4811"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Nugzter<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nugzter<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 9:51 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK,  <BR>Did you stalk Tom and the group when he was in KS? <BR>Your silly rhymes are just BS. <BR>A cerial box I must confess.... <BR>of all the clues, was it the best? <BR> P.S <BR>Mess with the best die like the rest. <BR>looool I gots rhymes toooo.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
