<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4824"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->So Far<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 11:04 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK: You must&#39;ve figured out by now that if you despised the Oteros in life, you&#39;ve certainly enshrined them in death.  Who they were will live on in pages upon pages of photographs, magazine articles, books and film media for as long as information survives.  Who you are will go the way of a cereal box at a town dump: picked at, eaten by worms, and shat out by crows.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
