<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4828"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:vicsgirl1023@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Shawna<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 11:30 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK, I think you are a coward of the worst kind. Saying you committed these crimes that obviously you were too scared to. You can&#39;t even admit to them.. lol.. but you want us to think you did them? LMAO You are so pitiful!!! Too old to kill now ... aren&#39;t ya? lol!!!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
