<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4834"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Redhead<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Redhead<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 11:44 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK you are such a little cowardly man.  You had a domineering mother that slept around causing you to hate women.  Come out of your little hole like the snake that you are. <BR> <BR>Shawna is right, too old to kill, too limp for other things.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
