<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4859"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 2:27 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK, you know you&#39;ll need to provide minutely  detailed information about any other victims. A cereal box in the vicinity of a couple kill scenes won&#39;t cut it today. This is the information age. Ante up.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
