<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4872"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->TraceCurran<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 4:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Bill, <BR>Your a big girl. <BR>Why do you play with toys? <BR>I thought you wanted to forget. <BR>What is it with you and womens things? <BR>Bold Boy. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
