<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4922"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ks_Chick<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 27, 2005 - 2:54 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK, The Public needs some useful Info, Not childish playful BS &#40;That is withheld from the public&#41; Give us some real clues would ya? Or Just go away and let everything go back to &#34;Normal&#34;. &amp; No more killing, Repent to the Lord now &amp; Just &#34;Maybe&#34; you&#39;ll have a chance.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
