<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4977"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ks_Chick<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 27, 2005 - 8:31 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK, They found # 7 Communication, They had a News briefing about this, This morning.  <BR>Why must you keep doing this? Give them some better clues, give yourself up or just stop ALL the mayhem. We don&#39;t want to see or hear about you hurting anyone else! People don&#39;t deserve your evil deeds. Repent to the lord, turn yourself in, tell your story to the world and we will all be happy!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
