<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4987"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Love of God<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 27, 2005 - 8:54 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK:                                                    I hear that youyou dropped off a package at a country road near Valley Center. Good get rid of all your past. I think that you are full of remorse&#39; and changing your life for the best.You sure have everyone wandering.  I hope you have turned your life over to Christ. The truth will set you free. Paul in the Bible was free even when he was in bonds. I am 66 years of age so I know it gets tougher, I also have heart trouble&#39; but I will allways follow Christ, and one day there will be no pain. If you are getting my messages, and have or are thinking about turning to God make your next drop at or near a Church, than I will know . Your Friend in Christ. In the name of Jesus I Pray that Mr X or the demons will leaveyou Amen                             <!--/Text--></td></tr>
