<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5580"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jesus Saves<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 12:39 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->btk, I feel sorry for you.  I don&#39;t suppose I should, but I do.  I feel sorry for you because you are damned in this world and you are damned in the next one.  To pay for the life you have lived will be absolute horror, to have lived the life you have lived must be a thousand times worse.  You are not capable of torturing anyone to the level you are tormented now or to the extent you will be tormented then.  Your entire existence is of no value to anyone, not even to yourself and you will be tossed like rubbish into the fire.  No saviour will come to greet you.  It would have been better if you had never been born.  Your mother&#39;s womb was cursed for bearing you.  I don&#39;t know what made you this way, I don&#39;t know how hard you tried to fight it but I wish you had tried harder, I wish you had tried until you sweated blood, because you will reap the whirlwind and there will be no peace on this earth for you.  And Hell will follow.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
