<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5586"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->jl<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 1:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I am a student studying criminal justice and yes... I find your story very interesting.  I know you want your story to be known and I personally thank you for your willingness to communicate with us.  There have been many posts as to how you should turn yourself in and &#34;come clean&#34; an yes, of course I agree.  I have a feeling you might allready have confessed your sins to God and perhaps that is why you are wanting your identity known.  I dont feel you are a coward for not just turning yourself in.  I myself have done many things that have hurt people and I know how it feels to want to get the monkey off your back but dont exactly know how to do it.  You just keep hoping that somehow the truth will be known so you give just enough information that it might lead to you.  someday it will, I just hope that you live to see that day.   All of us have made mistakes and sinned , and to God all sin is the same, so your sin is no greater than mine, so I stand in no judgement.  I know the reasons people turn to killing others are as broad as the killers themselves and maybe even you yourself do not know the reasons why you have committed horrendous crimes.  I am sorry for the people saying your Mothers womb was cursed for having you and you are damned etc.  Noone is damned for the sins they have committed, just for not turning to Jesus as their Savior.  You are still of value...to God, and yes, even to humanity.  We can learn from you just as weve learned from other people who HAVE walked in your shoes....even you are not alone in this world.  Great harm to this world has come from your hands, but that does not mean there is no hope for you.  The time is now to make right your wrongs.  Please keep communicating with us...there are people who truly do care and want for this to be finished.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
