<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5588"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->LOVE OF GOD<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 2:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK;  DON&#39;T LET ANY ONE FOOL YOU IF YOU ASK GOD FOR FORGIVENESS,IN HIS SONS NAME AND REALLY MEAN IT HE WILL FORGIVE YOU JUST AS HE HAS MANY OTHERS. REMEMBER JOHN 3;16 . I THINK THAT YOU NEED A FRIEND BUT ARE AFRAID. I UNDERSTAND WHERE YOU ARE COMING FROM. I LIVED IN THE WICHITA AREA FOR MANY YEARS MYSELF,DURING THE TIME OF YOUR RAMPAGE. I HAVE ALLWAYS BEEN INTERESTED IN WHAT CAUSED YOU TO DO WHAT YOU DID. ONLY YOU KNOW THAT. ALSO THE DEVIL KNOWS. SEND ME A MESSAGE IF YOU CAN. AS  ALLWAYS&#39; YOUR FRIEND IN CHRIST.                                            <!--/Text--></td></tr>
