<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5597"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jesus Saves<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 3:15 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->btk, Everything I have told you is true.  Do not be deceived.  The God that loves and saves also punishes and condemns.  You are not playing a game with the police or even society, you are playing a losing game with your immortal soul.  If anyone tells you God does not punish, they are dead wrong.  If anyone tells you God does not judge, they are perilously mistaken. If anyone tells you God does not destroy, they are dangerously misled.  The same God that sent the great flood has also created a lake of fire where the flames never go out and where there is no rest night or day.  God will have His retribution on those who will not obey Him and who rejected the salvation of His Son, Jesus.  Do not be misled.  Where you stand now, you are in dangerous opposition to God&#39;s will.  You revel in your sins, you boast of your iniquity.  God has said that He will punish those who do not accept His Gift of Salvation.  If your name is not written in the Book of the Lamb, you will be cast into the lake of fire where there will be weeping and gnashing of teeth.  Do not be deceived.  The God that promises salvation also promises judgment.  Do not fear man who can destroy the body, but fear Him who can destroy both body and soul in Hell.  Do not wait until you are given over unto a reprobate mind.  Do not wait until God hardens your heart because of your continuance in your iniquity and you cannot change.  Fear God, confess your sins, turn from your iniquity and seek Jesus and His salvation now before it is too late.  Do not let others deceive you, do not deceive yourself.  God is a God of love and a God of wrath. Turn from your sins and make a friend of Jesus while there is still time.  I say this to you and to anyone who does not believe that God punishes and destroys.  You have been told the Good News of Salvation and you have been warned.   <!--/Text--></td></tr>
