<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5599"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Clairevoient<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Clairevoient<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 3:29 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->“Good Morning Ma’am. I’m Officer Killman with the State Department of Motor Vehicles.  <BR>You are Mrs. Otero?... <BR>Yes... your husband was recently involved in a collision…  <BR>Yes, I just need his signature for…  <BR>I see….  <BR>Well, when will he be… I see. <BR>Would you mind if I wait inside then? It’s awfully cold out here… <BR>I’ll say, …my hands are freezing! <BR>Oh thank you… Thank you very much.  <BR> <BR>Better check your rear view mirror, B_ _T_ _ _K®. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
