<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5692"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 01, 2005 - 12:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->YOU must be so thoroughly enjoying all the dismay, fear, analyzation and research along with all the theories you see posted here.  -- Even though you are not worth any of these individuals, including mine, well, you do not deserve a single second of our thoughts in regard to you.  YOUR HEART is HARDENED and even tho our LORD is Divine and ALL forgiving, keep in mind there more than likely comes a time when even HE has had enough and can no longer forgive your repeated requests of help and forgiveness.  Best you be praying and redeeming yourself quite quickly....AND meaning it.  Do you really think our LORD WOULD ACTUALLY ALLOW YOU TO HAVE A PLACE BESIDE HIM....especially when your victims are allready sitting there with him?  Perhaps they have forgiven your evil deeds...but we as humans, still here on earth have a real hard time forgiving a devil such as you...and you just keep right on tormenting...the families and freinds left behind, forever missing their loved ones...and the general public, forever living in fear of you...Perhaps God DOES have a very special place in mind for you...only HE knows. <BR> <BR>BY THE WAY... <BR>There is a post from &#34;billythekid&#34; it states: <BR>WATCH -3 page letter-family protrait-under garmets <BR>need i say more <BR> <BR>Was that from you...Mr. Billy Boy <BR>Now you&#39;re even writing posts TO YOURSELF???????????? <BR>SCUM  FOOL  EVIL  THERE IS NO PLACE IN SOCIETY FOR YOU! <BR>AND JUST TO REPEAT MYSELF <BR>LEAVE OUR CHILDREN ALONE!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
