<!--Post: 5696--><!--Time: 1107291092-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5696"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name--> Love of God<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 01, 2005 - 12:51 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK:                                              I sent you a message earlier this morning &amp;  it was removed or erased. Once I bought a copy machine from a fellow in the N.W. part of Wichita. It was a very large used one, &amp; I had to have help to put it in the car. This fellow had several other copy machines he was working on for sale also. I wander if it was you. Oh well I may never know. If you would like to contact me let me know by making your next drop off by a Church,and I will give you more info. as how to contact you. I realy want to help you if I can, You need some one to talk to. Your friend.      <!--/Text--></td></tr>
