<!--Post: 5700--><!--Time: 1107293754-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5700"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->meagain<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 01, 2005 - 1:35 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->hey btk- <BR>U have mentioned WTC....it means Wichita Treatment Center doesn&#39;t it! I AM lettin wpd know. If you&#39;re watching, i suggest it&#39;s your OWN as&#42; that ur watchin! Have a wonderful day! <!--/Text--></td></tr>
