<!--Post: 5710--><!--Time: 1107298832-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5710"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->W.Hammer<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 01, 2005 - 3:00 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK we know you are hurting. You have obviously been mistreated someway in the past. You have not the slightest remorse for what you have done in tearing apart families. Your killing spree is nothing more than you striking out against someone in your past.  <BR> <BR>If you were in the Armed Forces and killed for a living, you killing license was revoked the minute you were out of harms way in combat.  May I ask you to turn yourself in so you can rest and not look over your shoulder. <BR> <BR>You are hurting from not only your past, but your life has been one hell after another. You and the monster need to come forward. WPD will make sure you get the proper treatment. Get a lawyer and turn yourself in. Tell your story and get the needed help.  Many know you were a truck driver by trade. You killed many more people than you are taking credit for. You have resurfaced back in Wichita because you were recently told bad news about your health. You had to give up truck driving and you are only living on your past murderous ventures now. <BR> <BR>You can keep playing cat and mouse with the WPD, or you can give yourself up and let the real story be told.  Your vanity is what keeps you from turning yourself in. You are also responsible for many murders on the Interstates and other areas.  Where you trying to say that you did not kill those other two women and dump their bodies?  Is that why one of your priced drops was by a no dumping sign? <BR> <BR>You are giving many clues to what and who you are. You might as well give up.  Giving up and being remorseful will help lessen the burden on your soul. There is an after life, and would you rather burn in hell, or repent and have the Lord lift you up on judgement day. If you think Prison, Jail or any type of incarceration is hell, think again.  Hell is forever.  Peace and let there be Peace.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5710-->
<!--Post: 5756--><!--Time: 1107350121-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5756"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->ZENITH<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 02, 2005 - 5:15 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Mr. BTK: <BR>I think I understand how your mind works, except why you let WPD and KAKE silence you. You seem satisfied to let them hide your messages. They mock you, they don&#39;t tell the public the whole truth. <BR>  <BR>The public isn&#39;t even worried anymore. I saw the news, no one&#39;s buying personal safety devices or guns anymore, they think it&#39;s just an impotent game, no threat.  <BR> <BR>If the public knew everything, what a difference it would make. Why is that ok with you? I really don&#39;t understand.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
