<!--Post: 5806--><!--Time: 1107387696-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5806"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rubyredshoe2<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rubyredshoe2<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 02, 2005 - 3:41 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->There is a limit to public interest -perhaps another event will cause this to fade in the backround. I&#39;m even starting to&#40;yawn&#41; get a little bored with this treasure hunt clues and cereal boxes like Blues Clues&#40; oooo- we found a clue&#41;Let&#39;s write it down. I guess with major world issues , a serial killer just doesn&#39;t cut it with me anymore....you know.....war in Iraq, 9/11, Tsunami in Asia.....kind of more important than you!! Don&#39;t exaggerate your self importance....Tom seems like a nice guy to have this forum but let&#39;s keep our priorities where they belong.....with the victims and their families. John Walsh is awesome and the WPD work everyday for good. They are my heroes. Has your blood pressure gone up lately? Don&#39;t forget to get refills on your medication. Get your cholesterol checked. Anything over 200 is getting to stroke territory!! You could always call Tom by phone. Just use a pay phone or &#42;67. He seems like he&#39;s on the level. Whatever. I know someone who died in an icestorm in a fall in January. It could happen and you will not have closure for yourself or the fame you seek. Please, no more cereal boxes ... gimmee a break!!!!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
