<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5848"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->TMBrown2004<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 02, 2005 - 7:59 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Kent T Billingham - there you go again - using your clues - subtract 2 - another instance of wanting us to subtact the two T&#39;s?  So, what significance does Ken Billingham have to you?  Is this in line with Kreisch?  Your clues are starting to make sense - now what?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
