<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5950"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Topsailgrl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Topsailgrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 12:53 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK-Do you like that picture of Shirley Vian on the start page? <BR> <BR>How many times have you looked at it? Over and over I am sure. <BR> <BR>Did you print it? Yea, I know you can&#39;t right click it but you can go to file/print cant you? <BR> <BR>Like how her smiling face almost fills the whole screen? I am sure you do, probably gives you a bit of a rush doesn&#39;t it? <BR> <BR>Staying up tonight to watch the interview with her son? Sure you are. Probably have the evening all planned out just for it. Tape/DVD is ready, right?  <BR> <BR>We all know you are getting off on this, mid-life crisis in full swing now, all of this attention sure does help with that don&#39;t it? <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
