<!--Post: 5956--><!--Time: 1107464865-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5956"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 1:07 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Probably have your dinner all planned out to...so you can eat it while you are enjoying the pain of Shirley&#39;s son...a little boy that YOU used....an innocent child....then you took his mommy away....I hope you choke on your dinner tonight...I hope your dreams are tormented...but I also hope Shirley&#39;s son&#39;s dreams are filled with peace and love....his mommy will be at his side tonight...and ALWAYS watching over him with her arms wrapped around him...something YOU quite obviously never had and NEVER WILL...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
