<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5957"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Time<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 1:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK <BR> <BR>&#34;I also hope Shirley&#39;s son&#39;s dreams are filled with peace and love....his mommy will be at his side tonight...and ALWAYS watching over him with her arms wrapped around him...something YOU quite obviously never had and NEVER WILL...&#34; <BR> <BR>Of all the things they have said to you on this forum, that one hurt the most, didn&#39;t it? <BR> <BR>I know.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
