<!--Post: 5959--><!--Time: 1107466859-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5959"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Redhead<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Redhead<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 1:40 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Your mommy&#39;s arms were always wrapped around someone else, weren&#39;t they?  Never time for little BTK.  That&#39;s your problem, isn&#39;t it? <BR> <BR>That and the fact your manhood has failed.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
