<!--Post: 5960--><!--Time: 1107466899-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5960"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bmodule<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bmodule<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 1:41 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->You had a pretty good run as far as serial killings go, but you realize that serial killers are a dime a dozen these days. Kansas even has one. Your book &#39;The BTK story&#39; if you can finish, will be just one more book about a serial killer, with convoluted facts and myths and half truths. The cat and mouse game and the spooky poetry have become laughable, not to mention the fact that the good info will never be released by the PD to back up your account. Your story will end in speculation, or as a non-outstanding case of multiple homocides, more likely than not,  overshadowed by the bizzare theories of amateur sleuths and profilers.  <BR> <BR>Its all been done before, except: no one has ever brought the monster in for debriefing while it was still up. When you get caught, the monster will abandon you, leaving you holding the bag, making your feeble excuses, crying in your hands like green river. Too bad. Thats a lot of hard work and planning for no payoff. <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5960-->
<!--Post: 5965--><!--Time: 1107468326-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5965"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 2:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Are we making you a little mad Mr. BEETEEKAY?  Shaking you up a little.  You would like for us to think that you are laughing at us....but I bet you&#39;re getting quite p&#42;&#42;&#42;ed off. <BR>Dangling carrots again to...hmmm 1993 murder....you know what.? <BR>Why don&#39;t you just give it up. <BR>STOP just STOP <BR>The best thing of all tho..is I can tell you right now....Tom is on to you.....HE WILL GET YOU! <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
