<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5982"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tippy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tippy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 3:18 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK - Now they&#39;ve swabbed Larry Hatteburg. <BR> <BR>They have NO CLUE.  Absolutely NONE. <BR> <BR>Obviously, none of the messages you sent them did any good.  They&#39;re swabbing people right and left.  I expect random highway roadblock-swabbings next. <BR> <BR>It would be funny if it were not so pathetic - and you were not so EVIL. <BR> <BR>You&#39;ve got a lot to answer for, buddy.   <BR>And so does the Wichita PD.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
