<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6047"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->mcattitude<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 8:45 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK  <BR>  Thank you for communicating again. Please find a way for us to know all about you. We really want to know the whole true story and in my opionion anyway the only way we get that is from you yourself. Please find a way. Still think about giving yourself up please. If something would  happen to you and you would die we would never know all there is to know. Thank You.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
