<!--Post: 6087--><!--Time: 1107530848-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6087"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->So Far<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 7:27 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK: <BR> <BR>Albert Camus wrote, &#34;The soul of the murderer is blind...&#34;  <BR> <BR>Explains your eyeglasses thing, I guess. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
