<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6094"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->W.Hammer<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 7:45 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK <BR> <BR>You have taken things from the kansas.com board and made them uniquely yours. I know you have been communicating on that board for some time now.  You took the Post Toasties and you also took the Home Depot and made those both happen. <BR> <BR>Make your next drop in the Wal-mart mens room.  Put your next drop in a Wal-mart plastic bag and hang it in the Handicap Stall.   <BR> <BR>I am not WPD nor any form of Law Enforcement. I am just an avid reader that can decipher when you post on boards. You are trying to tell your story, we need to get more from you.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
