<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6121"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Love of God<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 9:44 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK:  That was a nice thing you said to the people on KAKE TV, I mean about your sorry they had a cold. Could it be that there is some good in you after all,to care about your fellow human beings? I hope youare making a change for the better. Keep in touch with the Media, &amp; the Police that way we know that maybe you are changing for the better. I Pray you will not do any more killings, and I pray in Jesus name that the Monster has or will leave you. You know that God is watching all of us . Your Friend in Christ.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
