<!--Post: 6133--><!--Time: 1107544588-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6133"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ks_Chick<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 11:16 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK...If that truely is you &#40;which i doubt!&#41; That posted &#34;BOO HOO&#34; to Charlie O, You make me sick! How dare you post such a thing to him after the hel&#42; he has been thru in life Because of you &amp; Ur evil deeds. But you know what? The world will be saying &#34;Boo hoo&#34; to you when you are locked up for the remainder of your life! Personally I wish LE would let Charlie &amp; The other victims family members just have at ya when you are caught...While we all get to watch &amp; laugh &amp; say &#34;boo hoo&#34; to you as you are being tortured &amp; getting ur A&#42;&#42; royally whooped!  <BR>Just My Opinion &amp; Thoughts... =&#41;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6133-->
<!--Post: 6138--><!--Time: 1107547462-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6138"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->W.Hammer<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 12:04 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK <BR> <BR>The time is now. Turn yourself in. Get a good lawyer and have him help you. Lets get your book written and your facts all told. We know that you want so bad to tell your story. We will all listen quite intently. Your reasons for killing and torturing want to be known and understood. <BR> <BR>What did these people do so wrong?  Were you given the gift to take a life?  Why are you playing God and why all hoopla now about who you killed?  Why not why you killed, and how many you killed?  What were you thinking when you forced your way into Shirley Vian&#39;s house?  A 5 year old boy opens the door and you take over the house. You brandish a gun, close the curtains, shut off TV. You have Shirley put toys and blankets in the bathroom. You tie one door shut, and you push the bed up against the other bathroom door.  The 5 year old could see you stripping and killing his mother. He remembers trying to untie the rope around her neck. <BR> <BR>Why did you take the love of those three youngsters life?  How could you be so callous and cruel.  Did they do anything to you?  I don&#39;t believe they did. You have put a nightmare for life in each one of the living victims from your slaughter.  What is your motive?  What makes this so right in your mind?  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
